  "block4_descriptions": {
    "3": ["Two front row allies attack", "one enemy in sync, dealing", "massive damage."],
    "4": ["Back row magic charges a", "front weapon. One blow that", "stuns even resistant foes."],
    "5": ["Back row magic holds a foe", "still for a front attack.", "A good hold cannot miss."],
    "6": ["Magic lifts an ally high", "for an opening dive attack", "that lowers foe defense."],
    "7": ["Two adjacent allies strike", "the foes at both row ends.", "These blows always land."],
    "8": ["Crossed magic drags a foe", "forward into a double", "attack. Best vs frail foes."],
    "9": ["The front row guards,", "shrugging off ailments and", "blocking the enemy Rush."],
    "10": ["Two back row allies raise", "a barrier that dampens", "magic and aids resistance."],
    "11": ["A mighty barrier covers", "the field. Neither side", "can cast spells this turn."],
    "12": ["Conjures decoy doubles of", "the party. A double takes", "the hit, then vanishes."],
    "13": ["The party scatters as foes", "breathe, cutting breath and", "magic harm. Melee harm up."],
    "14": ["A tight formation that", "blunts physical attacks,", "but breath and magic hurt."],
    "15": ["When a guarded ally is", "attacked, back row fire", "cuts the blow each time."],
    "16": ["The back row opens fire", "before the assault,", "raising the party's aim."],
    "17": ["Ranged fire interrupts a", "foe's spellcasting.", "Limited uses each turn."],
    "18": ["Ranged fire interrupts a", "foe's breath attack.", "Limited uses each turn."],
    "19": ["A front row ally shields a", "guarded back row ally, even", "from ranged attacks."],
    "20": ["When the decoy is struck,", "flank counters break the", "foes' combo. Limited uses."],
    "21": ["Three casters widen spell", "reach, weaken foes' resist", "and boost spell power."],
    "22": ["Unseals every ally's magic", "and shatters enemy Magic", "Shell and Anti-Magic Shell."],
    "23": ["Adjacent casters who share", "a spell cast it swiftly,", "outpacing Anti-Magic Shell."],
    "24": ["Lays a spell on an ally's", "weapon. A hit delivers it", "through any Magic Shell."],
    "25": ["Two casters weave one", "spell together, greatly", "amplifying its power."],
    "26": ["Three allies pile onto one", "enemy, and each new hit", "lands harder than the last."],
    "27": ["When the decoy is struck,", "allies circle behind the", "foe for a crushing blow."],
    "28": ["Focus Attack, evolved by a", "Knight. Launches the foe", "skyward, striking twice."],
    "29": ["The party charges the foes,", "harming them all. Only", "Front Guard can stop it."],
    "30": ["Two allies feint while the", "third dives at a weak spot", "with soaring critical rate."],
    "31": ["A holy sign woven by two", "allies casts a mighty", "Dispel. Undead beware."],
    "32": ["Three allies dive from a", "warp gate, piercing foe", "defense, safe in the air."],
    "33": ["Slay Crush, evolved by a", "Monk. A charge that cuts", "both ways and slays undead."],
    "34": ["W Slash, evolved by a", "Knight. Blade waves may cut", "foes behind the target."],
    "35": ["Three allies sweep the", "whole enemy front row.", "Weak, but hits nimble foes."],
    "36": ["Stun Smash, evolved by a", "thief. A feint sets up a", "strike that stuns the foe."],
    "37": ["Back Attack, evolved by a", "Samurai. A keen counter", "that can even paralyze."],
    "38": ["S.J Attack, evolved by a", "Dark Knight. A quaking blow", "stuns and hurts all foes."],
